      "status": "not_affected",
      "impact_statement": "Évaluation d'Espressif (cve-exclude-list) : A timer command submitted by an unprivileged task is executed by the timer service task as a caller-supplied function call. Affects only MPU-enabled ports (GHSA-w3vr-pr75-5hc6). ESP-IDF ships the xtensa, riscv and linux ports only, none of which set portUSING_MPU_WRAPPERS, so the MPU wrappers and the privilege boundary they enforce are not built. Same reasoning as CVE-2024-28115, already excluded in the FreeRTOS-Kernel manifest."
    },
